## Graal native image. Generated by nativeimage.gradle; delete this line if you ever hand-write one.
**/resource-config.json

## Claude's sandbox: the provisioned toolchain, the Gradle cache and verify.sh's log. All regenerated
## on demand, and none of it belongs to anyone but the machine that made it.
/ai/

## A personal note-to-self skill, not part of the project: what a session can and cannot do about
## the power state of Mateusz's own machine. Useful to whoever is sitting at this checkout and
## meaningless to anyone else, so it stays out of the history.
/.claude/skills/shutdown-windows/

## Generated from assets-raw/ by `./gradlew :core:packTextures`, which is deliberately not wired into
## every build. NOTE: that means a fresh clone has no atlas. Harmless today because there is no source
## art yet - but when there is, this becomes a real choice: commit the atlas, or make packing part of
## the build. Do not let it be settled by whoever next hits a missing texture.
/assets/atlas/
/assets/assets.txt
